# @name loginFinanzas
POST {{baseUrl}}/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "finanzas",
  "password": "Finanzas123!"
}

###


### Listar tareas activas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### Obtener una tarea por id (incluye su hito)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### Id inexistente -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas/999999
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### ===== RBAC por rol =====
### creativo lee tareas -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCreativo.response.body.access_token}}

### creativo NO puede crear tareas -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCreativo.response.body.access_token}}

{ "hito_id": 1, "nombre": "x" }

### finanzas NO tiene concesión sobre tareas -> 403
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFinanzas.response.body.access_token}}

### sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/tareas
